---
// Kiwi Industry Category & Search Intent Selector (Dark Purple Theme)
---

<div class="industry-module-card card-surface" id="industry-tabs-module">
  <div class="industry-module-header">
    <div class="badge-pill">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      <span>NZ Industry Strategy Matrix</span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="industry-module-title">Tailored Google Maps strategies by industry</h3>
    <p class="industry-module-sub">Select your trade to see the specific category architecture, high-intent searches, and review formulas that drive calls.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Tab Bar Navigation -->
  <div class="industry-tab-bar" role="tablist">
    <button type="button" class="ind-tab active" data-tab="tradies" role="tab" aria-selected="true">
      <span class="tab-icon">🔧</span>
      <span>Tradies & Trades</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="ind-tab" data-tab="health" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
      <span class="tab-icon">🩺</span>
      <span>Clinics & Health</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="ind-tab" data-tab="driving" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
      <span class="tab-icon">🚗</span>
      <span>Driving & Mobile</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="ind-tab" data-tab="legal" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
      <span class="tab-icon">⚖️</span>
      <span>Legal & Professional</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- Tab Contents -->
  <div class="industry-tab-content-area">
    <!-- Tab 1: Tradies -->
    <div class="ind-panel active" id="panel-tradies" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="panel-grid">
        <div class="panel-box">
          <span class="panel-tag">Top Primary Categories</span>
          <h4 class="panel-h4">Plumber, Electrician, Gasfitter, Builder</h4>
          <p>The biggest mistake is selecting "Handyman" or "Construction Company". Pick the exact high-search trade, then add specific secondary categories like "Hot water system supplier" or "Drainage service".</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-box">
          <span class="panel-tag">High-Intent NZ Search Terms</span>
          <h4 class="panel-h4">"emergency plumber [suburb]", "blocked drain near me"</h4>
          <p>Tradie searchers are in urgent need. Over 80% tap the click-to-call button directly from the Google 3-pack without visiting the website first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-box full-width">
          <span class="panel-tag">Winning Review Reply Formula</span>
          <div class="quote-box">
            "Thanks for trusting us to fix your hot water cylinder in <strong>Papakura</strong>, Dave! Glad our team could get your gas hot water running the same afternoon."
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 2: Health & Dental -->
    <div class="ind-panel" id="panel-health" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="panel-grid">
        <div class="panel-box">
          <span class="panel-tag">Top Primary Categories</span>
          <h4 class="panel-h4">Dentist, Physiotherapist, Chiropractor</h4>
          <p>Storefront verification is critical. Secondary categories should reflect high-margin treatments: "Cosmetic dentist", "Teeth whitening service", "Emergency dental service".</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-box">
          <span class="panel-tag">High-Intent NZ Search Terms</span>
          <h4 class="panel-h4">"dentist [suburb]", "emergency tooth pain auckland"</h4>
          <p>Patients look closely at total review count, recent 5-star ratings, and clear opening hours before making an online appointment booking.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-box full-width">
          <span class="panel-tag">Winning Review Reply Formula</span>
          <div class="quote-box">
            "Thank you for visiting our clinic in <strong>Takapuna</strong>, Sarah! We're so pleased our gentle dental team made your hygiene treatment comfortable."
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 3: Driving & Mobile -->
    <div class="ind-panel" id="panel-driving" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="panel-grid">
        <div class="panel-box">
          <span class="panel-tag">Top Primary Categories</span>
          <h4 class="panel-h4">Driving School, Mobile Mechanic</h4>
          <p>Service-Area Business (SAB) setup: Hide residential addresses to avoid suspension, and specify exact licensed territorial suburbs across your city.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-box">
          <span class="panel-tag">High-Intent NZ Search Terms</span>
          <h4 class="panel-h4">"driving instructor [area]", "restricted test lessons nz"</h4>
          <p>Parents and students search for high pass rates and immediate weekend availability. Geo-grid radius expansion wins bookings in neighbouring suburbs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-box full-width">
          <span class="panel-tag">Winning Review Reply Formula</span>
          <div class="quote-box">
            "Huge congratulations on passing your restricted driving test in <strong>Westgate</strong> on the first attempt, Liam! Safe driving out there."
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 4: Legal & Professional -->
    <div class="ind-panel" id="panel-legal" role="tabpanel">
      <div class="panel-grid">
        <div class="panel-box">
          <span class="panel-tag">Top Primary Categories</span>
          <h4 class="panel-h4">Lawyer, Conveyancer, Accountant</h4>
          <p>Requires practitioner profiles + practice firm profile synchronization. E-E-A-T credentials, NZ Law Society / CA ANZ verification must match website.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-box">
          <span class="panel-tag">High-Intent NZ Search Terms</span>
          <h4 class="panel-h4">"property lawyer [city]", "small business accountant near me"</h4>
          <p>Clients search for trust, specialist accreditations, and transparent fee schedules before initiating a consultation call.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-box full-width">
          <span class="panel-tag">Winning Review Reply Formula</span>
          <div class="quote-box">
            "Thank you for choosing our team for your commercial property conveyance in <strong>Christchurch</strong>, Mark. It was a pleasure assisting your business."
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.ind-tab');
  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.ind-panel');

  tabs.forEach((tab) => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const target = tab.getAttribute('data-tab');

      tabs.forEach((t) => {
        t.classList.remove('active');
        t.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');
      });
      panels.forEach((p) => p.classList.remove('active'));

      tab.classList.add('active');
      tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');
      document.getElementById(`panel-${target}`)?.classList.add('active');
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .industry-module-card {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .industry-module-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.25rem auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .industry-module-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem);
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .industry-module-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* Tab Bar */
  .industry-tab-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .ind-tab {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background-color: rgba(16, 2, 26, 0.6);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
    padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #E2D4F0;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .ind-tab:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary-light);
    background-color: rgba(157, 56, 224, 0.2);
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .ind-tab.active {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9D38E0 0%, #6D10A3 100%);
    color: var(--color-white);
    border-color: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.5);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(157, 56, 224, 0.4);
  }

  .tab-icon {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  /* Panels */
  .ind-panel {
    display: none;
    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ind-panel.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .panel-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .panel-box {
    background: rgba(18, 2, 31, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .panel-box.full-width {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    background: rgba(36, 6, 56, 0.7);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  .panel-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  .panel-h4 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .panel-box p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .quote-box {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #E9D5FF;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .quote-box strong {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .panel-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
